{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908/events","html_url":"https://github.com/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908","id":1677907351,"node_id":"I_kwDOCA8Bec5kAtWX","number":4908,"title":"ast.parse() fails to handle \"A[1:2, *l]\" after it is parsed and unparsed.","user":{"login":"xiaxinmeng","id":22271286,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcxMjg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22271286?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng","html_url":"https://github.com/xiaxinmeng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xiaxinmeng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2023-04-21T06:26:11Z","updated_at":"2023-04-21T06:26:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"See the following example, code_1 can be parsed normally with ast.parse(). Then we unparse the tree_1 and to parse the code again and it fails. This test program can work normally on CPython .  \r\n\r\ntest.py\r\n```\r\nimport ast\r\ncode_1= \"A[1:2, *l]\"\r\ntree_1 = ast.parse(code_1) #work normally\r\n\r\ncode_2 = ast.unparse(tree_1)\r\nprint(code_2)   # str \"A[1:2, *l]\"\r\ntree_2 = ast.parse(code_2)  #fail\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected output: work normally\r\n\r\n\r\nActual output:\r\n```\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/xxm/Desktop/RustPython/test.py\", line 345, in <module>\r\n    tree_2 = ast.parse(code_2)  #fail\r\n  File \"/home/xxm/.cargo/git/checkouts/rustpython-f8ef4d934ac33cd8/471ec26/pylib/Lib/ast.py\", line 51, in parse\r\n    _feature_version=feature_version)\r\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax. Got unexpected token ':' at line 1 column 5\r\nA[(1:2, *l)]\r\n    ^\r\n```\r\n\r\nEnvironment\r\nUbuntu 18.04\r\nRustPython 0.2.0\r\nCPython 3.11.3","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4908/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}